### 4 Deploy contract di layer 2 anvil

---

Deploy contract di layer 2

```bash
forge script script/DeployUTXO.s.sol:DeployL2UTXO --rpc-url http://localhost:8545 --broadcast
```

Address contract baru hasil deploy copy ke file .env

```bash
{
  "transactions": [
    {
      "hash": "<REDACTED>",
      "transactionType": "CREATE",
      "contractName": "PlasmaChainUTXO",
      "contractAddress": "0x2860763ac53e487b1521dfd6510f6780b2d86223",
      "function": null,
      "arguments": null,
      "transaction": {
        "from": "0xf89e9dad9b8c5382c0729928542abfaa64b67dda",
        "gas": "0x2f0c0c",
        "value": "0x0",
        "input": "<REDACTED>",
        "nonce": "0x0",
        "chainId": "0x7a69"
      },
      "additionalContracts": [],
      "isFixedGasLimit": false
    }
  ],
```

### Restart Semua Service (Dengan State)

```bash
# Semua state akan ter-load otomatis
./anvil.sh restart
cd backend && npm run start:utxo
cd relay && npm run dev:utxo
```

---

## Clean Start (Reset Semua)

Untuk memulai fresh tanpa data:

```bash
# Hapus semua state files
./anvil.sh clean
rm -rf backend/data/
rm relay/.relay_state.json

# Start fresh
./anvil.sh start-fresh
cd backend && npm run start:utxo
cd relay && npm run dev:utxo
```

---

## Troubleshooting

### Anvil tidak bisa load state

```bash
./anvil.sh clean
./anvil.sh start-fresh
```

### Backend state corrupt

```bash
rm -rf backend/data/
npm run start:utxo
```

### Relay state corrupt

```bash
rm relay/.relay_state.json
npm run dev:utxo
```

### Check semua status

```bash
./anvil.sh status
curl http://localhost:3001/api/persistence/status
cat relay/.relay_state.json
```
